tail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div>\n      <h1>Pricing</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Simple, transparent plans that grow with your team. Start free, upgrade when you're ready.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Billing toggle -->\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"muted small\" id=\"billing-monthly-label\">Monthly</span>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" id=\"billing-toggle\" aria-label=\"Switch billing period\">\n        <span id=\"toggle-text\">Switch to yearly</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\" id=\"save-badge\" style=\"margin-left:6px;\">Save 20%</span>\n      </button>\n      <span class=\"muted small\" id=\"billing-yearly-label\" style=\"opacity:0\">Yearly</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Plan cards -->\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\" id=\"plans-grid\">\n      <!-- Free -->\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Free</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">For individuals getting started</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin:1rem 0;\">\n          <div class=\"row between\">\n            <span class=\"stat-value\" data-monthly=\"$0\" data-yearly=\"$0\">$0</span>\n            <span class=\"muted small\" id=\"free-period\">forever</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <hr>\n        <ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 1.25rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;\">\n          <li class=\"row gap-sm\"><span style=\"color:var(--accent,#5b6abf);\">✓</span> 3 active projects</li>\n          <li class=\"row gap-sm\"><span style=\"color:var(--accent,#5b6abf);\">✓</span> 1 GB storage</li>\n          <li class=\"row gap-sm\"><span style=\"color:var(--accent,#5b6abf);\">✓</span> Basic analytics dashboard</li>\n          <li class=\"row gap-sm\"><span style=\"color:var(--accent,#5b6abf);\">✓</span> 2 team members</li>\n          <li class=\"row gap-sm\"><span style=\"color:var(--accent,#5b6abf);\">✓</span> Community forum support</li>\n          <li class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"muted\">✗</span> <span class=\"muted\">Custom integrations</span></li>\n          <li class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"muted\">✗</span> <span class=\"muted\">API access</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\">Start for Free</button>\n        <p class=\"small muted center\" style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;\">No credit card required</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Pro -->\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"border:2px solid var(--accent,#5b6abf);position:relative;\">\n        <div class=\"badge\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-0.7rem;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--accent,#5b6abf);color:#fff;\">Most Popular</div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Pro</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">For growing teams that need power</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin:1rem 0;\">\n          <div class=\"row between\">\n            <span class=\"stat-value\" data-monthly=\"$12\" data-yearly=\"$10\">$12</span>\n            <span class=\"muted small\" data-monthly=\"/user /mo\" data-yearly=\"/user /mo\" id=\"pro-period\">/user /mo</sp